WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.608 --> 00:00:02.670
"Princess Hundred Flowers tricked me!"

2
00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:03.731
said the monster.

3
00:00:03.831 --> 00:00:05.472
He stamped his foot.

4
00:00:05.812 --> 00:00:06.193
he sighed.

5
00:00:06.213 --> 00:00:13.959
"I can't be angry with her.

6
00:00:14.039 --> 00:00:30.888
I love her too much.

7
00:00:31.108 --> 00:00:32.609
that pig got away.

8
00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:37.392
He'll go back to the king, and troops will come."

9
00:00:39.253 --> 00:00:40.633
monster thought for a minute.

10
00:00:42.694 --> 00:00:44.155
Finally he had a plan.

11
00:00:45.276 --> 00:00:46.737
He went to the princess' room.

12
00:00:52.019 --> 00:00:53.700
sweet," said the monster.

13
00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.662
"I'm going to visit your father."

14
00:00:57.823 --> 00:01:01.228
"What?" said Princess Hundred Flowers in shock.

15
00:01:02.509 --> 00:01:07.091
"I'm going to tell him what a nice fellow I am," said the monster.

16
00:01:07.111 --> 00:01:10.132
"We can all be a happy family."

17
00:01:11.492 --> 00:01:15.514
Before the princess could say another word, the monster left the room.

18
00:01:22.617 --> 00:01:25.298
need a disguise," he said to himself.

19
00:01:26.118 --> 00:01:27.559
He recited a quick spell.

20
00:01:28.959 --> 00:01:29.940
Light sparkled.

21
00:01:30.696 --> 00:01:33.258
Now the monster looked like a handsome young man.

22
00:01:33.278 --> 00:01:36.061
"Ha-ha!" he laughed.

23
00:01:39.964 --> 00:01:42.846
Bajie ran back to the Precious Image Kingdom.

24
00:01:44.688 --> 00:01:48.811
He told the king that he and Wujing couldn't save Princess Hundred Flowers.

25
00:01:50.332 --> 00:01:51.493
pig hung his head.

26
00:01:51.513 --> 00:01:55.016
"As I ran away, Wujing was captured."

27
00:01:56.597 --> 00:01:58.719
"We must save my daughter," said the king.

28
00:02:01.312 --> 00:02:02.233
turned to his general.

29
00:02:03.193 --> 00:02:04.053
"Gather the troops!"

30
00:02:05.394 --> 00:02:07.255
A messenger ran into the court.

31
00:02:07.275 --> 00:02:11.677
"Your Majesty, your son-in-law is here to see you," said the messenger.

32
00:02:13.297 --> 00:02:14.578
king was confused.

33
00:02:14.598 --> 00:02:16.399
"I don't have a son-in-law!"

34
00:02:17.759 --> 00:02:20.200
A handsome young man walked into the hall.

35
00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:22.061
"Hello, Father.

36
00:02:22.481 --> 00:02:24.702
I'm sorry I haven't visited you until now."

37
00:02:26.243 --> 00:02:26.863
"Who are you?"

38
00:02:27.244 --> 00:02:27.864
asked the king.

39
00:02:28.964 --> 00:02:32.885
"I married Princess Hundred Flowers 13 years ago," said the young man.

40
00:02:37.467 --> 00:02:40.747
found her in a forest just as a tiger was about to attack her.

41
00:02:41.628 --> 00:02:43.708
I saved her life and chased away the tiger."

42
00:02:44.609 --> 00:02:45.889
king relaxed a little.

43
00:02:45.909 --> 00:02:48.010
"That was very brave."

44
00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:52.311
"Yes, it very brave," said the young man.

45
00:02:52.331 --> 00:02:56.332
"However, that tiger has wanted revenge ever since.

46
00:02:58.428 --> 00:02:59.589
ago it became a spirit.

47
00:03:00.189 --> 00:03:01.970
Now it disguises itself as a monk."

48
00:03:04.071 --> 00:03:07.332
The young man narrowed his eyes at the Tang Monk and pointed.

49
00:03:07.352 --> 00:03:08.793
"That monk!"

50
00:03:09.833 --> 00:03:11.674
"What!" cried the Tang Monk.

51
00:03:12.575 --> 00:03:13.555
The king frowned.

52
00:03:13.575 --> 00:03:14.836
"I don't believe you."

53
00:03:16.456 --> 00:03:18.057
"I'll prove it," said the young man.

54
00:03:20.078 --> 00:03:22.699
He pointed at the monk again and recited a spell.

55
00:03:23.499 --> 00:03:24.440
Light sparkled.

56
00:03:27.052 --> 00:03:28.192
Everybody gasped.

57
00:03:29.193 --> 00:03:32.233
Now a tiger sat in the Tang Monk's spot!

58
00:03:34.534 --> 00:03:38.435
Later, in the stable, a boy was giving hay to the Tang Monk's horse.

59
00:03:38.455 --> 00:03:41.716
"Did you hear about the Tang Monk?"

60
00:03:42.176 --> 00:03:43.056
asked another boy.

61
00:03:43.076 --> 00:03:46.057
"He was really a tiger spirit.

62
00:03:47.198 --> 00:03:50.638
A handsome young man changed him back into his true form."

63
00:03:50.658 --> 00:03:53.919
"Wow," said the first boy.

64
00:03:53.939 --> 00:03:55.880
"Where is the tiger now?"

65
00:03:57.056 --> 00:04:00.398
"He's locked up in a cage," said the other boy.

66
00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:07.842
That night Bajie was sitting alone outside when he heard a voice.

67
00:04:07.862 --> 00:04:10.523
"Psst!" said the voice.

68
00:04:10.543 --> 00:04:13.685
"Bajie!" looked around.

69
00:04:13.705 --> 00:04:15.326
"Who's calling me?"

70
00:04:16.947 --> 00:04:19.488
He saw the horse peeking from behind a wall.

71
00:04:19.508 --> 00:04:22.670
"You're talking!"

72
00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:23.830
cried Bajie.

73
00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:26.452
"Shh," said the horse.

74
00:04:27.232 --> 00:04:28.192
"We have a problem.

75
00:04:29.053 --> 00:04:31.413
A young man turned the Tang Monk into a tiger.

76
00:04:32.453 --> 00:04:34.354
The monk is locked in a cage now."

77
00:04:34.374 --> 00:04:36.375
"Oh, I know!"

78
00:04:36.715 --> 00:04:37.495
cried Bajie.

79
00:04:37.515 --> 00:04:38.835
"It's terrible!

80
00:04:39.635 --> 00:04:43.757
Master is now a tiger, and Wujing was captured by a monster."

81
00:04:45.757 --> 00:04:47.938
sighed. "The journey is over.

82
00:04:48.718 --> 00:04:49.898
Let's just go home."

83
00:04:50.939 --> 00:04:52.899
The horse bit Bajie on the leg.

84
00:04:53.459 --> 00:04:55.240
"Ouch!" cried the pig.

85
00:04:56.928 --> 00:04:58.089
"Why did you do that?"

86
00:04:58.109 --> 00:04:59.770
"We're not going home!"

87
00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:00.650
said the horse.

88
00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:04.493
"The young man is probably just the monster in disguise.

89
00:05:05.433 --> 00:05:08.035
We need to defeat him and save our companions."

90
00:05:09.476 --> 00:05:10.136
"But how?"

91
00:05:10.616 --> 00:05:11.457
asked Bajie.

92
00:05:12.297 --> 00:05:13.618
The horse thought for a minute.

93
00:05:14.939 --> 00:05:16.080
must find Wukong.

94
00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:17.481
He can help us."

95
00:05:19.382 --> 00:05:20.002
shook his head.

96
00:05:20.022 --> 00:05:22.224
"He won't help
